WEBVTT

00:00.948 --> 00:03.879
[tropical music]
[热带音乐]

00:03.948 --> 00:10.189
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:11.706 --> 00:12.913
[amoebas mooing]
[阿米巴原虫的叫声]

00:12.982 --> 00:14.741
- [straining]
- [紧张]

00:14.810 --> 00:17.120
[laughs]
Yee-ha!
[笑]
呀哈！

00:17.189 --> 00:18.672
Get along, little amoebas!
和睦相处吧，小阿米巴虫！

00:18.741 --> 00:20.224
[amoebas mooing]
[阿米巴原虫的叫声]

00:20.293 --> 00:21.500
[watch ticking]
[观察滴答声]

00:21.568 --> 00:22.948
I did it!
我做到了！

00:23.017 --> 00:25.189
It's sarsaparilla time!
现在是沙士时间！

00:25.258 --> 00:27.189
[amoebas mooing]
[阿米巴原虫的叫声]

00:28.224 --> 00:30.500
[grunts] Yah!
[buzzing]
[咕哝] 啊！
[嗡嗡声]

00:32.017 --> 00:34.948
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

00:35.017 --> 00:36.706
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:37.844 --> 00:39.431
Holy osmosis!
神圣渗透！

00:39.500 --> 00:42.500
I lived as an amoeba
for a whole week!
我像阿米巴原虫一样生活
整整一个星期！

00:42.568 --> 00:44.120
[straining]
[紧张]

00:44.189 --> 00:46.362
Hm.
Mm-hmm.
嗯。
嗯嗯。

00:47.672 --> 00:48.465
[line trilling]
[行颤音]

00:48.534 --> 00:49.775
- Can't get it to work,
- 无法让它工作，

00:49.844 --> 00:52.017
can never get it to work!
[phone ringing]
永远无法让它发挥作用！
[电话铃声]

00:52.086 --> 00:53.603
[yelling indistinctly]
- Hello?
[含糊不清地喊叫]
- 你好？

00:53.672 --> 00:55.500
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

00:55.568 --> 00:57.327
Karen, my Mainframe!
凯伦，我的主机！

00:57.396 --> 01:00.017
I just made
a scientific breakthrough.
我刚刚做了
科学突破。

01:00.086 --> 01:02.086
Let's go out
and celebrate, girl!
我们出去吧
庆祝吧，女孩！

01:02.155 --> 01:04.741
- I'm sorry, Sandy.
I can't hear you
- 对不起，桑迪。
我听不到你说话

01:04.810 --> 01:07.810
because someone can't shut up!
因为有人无法闭嘴！

01:07.879 --> 01:10.672
- That's okay, Karen.
I'll tell you all about later.
- 没关系，凯伦。
稍后我会告诉你一切。

01:10.741 --> 01:13.017
Let's meet up tonight
at the corner café!
今晚我们见面吧
在街角的咖啡馆！

01:13.086 --> 01:14.879
- You got it, Bushy Tushy.
- 你明白了，布希·图希。

01:14.948 --> 01:17.534
I will definitely be there.
我一定会在那里。

01:17.603 --> 01:19.362
Okay, I'm off.
好吧，我走了。

01:19.431 --> 01:20.948
- Those are not my test tubes!
-那些不是我的试管！

01:21.017 --> 01:22.155
- Ugh.
- I don't know where
- 呃。
- 我不知道在哪里

01:22.224 --> 01:23.844
they came from!
- Don't wait up.
他们来自！
- 别等了。

01:23.913 --> 01:25.568
- [grunts]
[glass shatters]
- [咕哝]
[玻璃碎裂]

01:26.362 --> 01:29.224
- [muttering excitedly]
Whoa.
- [兴奋地嘀咕]
哇哦。

01:29.293 --> 01:31.741
- [sighs]
Don't forget to signal.
- [叹气]
别忘了打信号。

01:31.810 --> 01:34.086
- Oh, thanks
for that Mrs. Puff, I--
-哦，谢谢
为了那位普芙夫人，我——

01:36.086 --> 01:37.120
[phone rings]
[电话铃声]

01:37.189 --> 01:38.362
- Hello?
- 你好？

01:38.431 --> 01:40.465
- [grunts]
Howdy, Powder Puff!
- [咕哝]
你好，粉扑！

01:40.534 --> 01:42.500
You wanna step out with me
and Karen tonight?
你想和我一起出去
今晚凯伦呢？

01:42.568 --> 01:46.120
- Oh, yes, Sandy!
I desperately need to step out.
- 哦，是的，桑迪！
我迫切需要走出去。

01:46.189 --> 01:48.672
[laughs]
- Ooh! You're talking to Sandy?
[笑]
- 哦！你在和桑迪说话吗？

01:48.741 --> 01:50.431
Mrs. Puff, tell her
I said, "Hi!"
泡芙太太，告诉她
我说：“嗨！”

01:50.500 --> 01:51.844
Tell her I said, "Hi!"
告诉她我说：“嗨！”

01:51.913 --> 01:53.982
- We'll all meet up
at the corner café tonight.
- 我们都会见面
今晚在街角的咖啡馆。

01:54.051 --> 01:55.706
Get ready to party, y'all!
准备好参加派对吧，你们！

01:55.775 --> 01:58.086
- Okay! See you soon!
- Tell her I said, "Hi!"
- 好的！再见！
- 告诉她我说：“嗨！”

01:58.155 --> 02:00.293
- Whoo.
- Tell her I said, "Hi!"
- 呼。
- 告诉她我说：“嗨！”

02:00.982 --> 02:03.120
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

02:03.189 --> 02:06.500
- Mrs. Puff!
Tell her I said, "Hi!"
- 泡芙夫人！
告诉她我说：“嗨！”

02:07.258 --> 02:09.568
- Yeah!
[both slurping]
- 是的！
[两人都发出咕噜声]

02:09.637 --> 02:11.327
- Ah.
- [computerized noises]
- 啊。
- [电脑噪音]

02:11.396 --> 02:13.431
- [slurping, sighs]
- [吸吮，叹气]

02:13.500 --> 02:14.741
[sneezes]
[打喷嚏]

02:15.465 --> 02:17.568
Y'all are never gonna believe
what I did this week.
你们永远不会相信
我这周做了什么。

02:17.637 --> 02:20.017
It's about as crazy
as a mule with a top hat.
这同样疯狂
作为一头戴着高礼帽的骡子。

02:20.086 --> 02:23.224
- Was it crazier than this?
"Tell Sandy I said, 'Hi!'
- 还有比这更疯狂的吗？
“告诉桑迪我说，‘嗨！’

02:23.293 --> 02:24.913
Tell Sandy I said 'Hi!'"
告诉桑迪我说‘嗨！’”

02:24.982 --> 02:26.706
[mimics SpongeBob laugh]
[模仿海绵宝宝的笑声]

02:26.775 --> 02:27.913
[sighs]
[叹气]

02:27.982 --> 02:29.741
- Sorry your day
was tough, Puff.
- 对不起你的一天
很难，帕夫。

02:29.810 --> 02:31.948
But my news will cheer
your head off.
但我的消息会让人欢呼
你的头掉下来。

02:32.017 --> 02:34.155
I lived as
a microscopic organism
我的生活是
微观有机体

02:34.224 --> 02:35.568
for a whole week!
整整一个星期！

02:35.637 --> 02:37.534
- That's great, Sandy,
but I've lived
- 太好了，桑迪，
但我曾经活过

02:37.603 --> 02:40.982
with a microscopic organism
for 26 years
与微生物
26年来

02:41.051 --> 02:43.672
and wait until you hear what
that pipsqueak did today.
等到你听到什么
那个小点子今天做了。

02:43.741 --> 02:46.431
He leaves his little telescope
on the floor,
他留下了他的小望远镜
在地板上，

02:46.500 --> 02:48.879
I rolled over it.
It hurt like heck!
我翻过它。
疼得要命！

02:48.948 --> 02:51.362
And then, he gets mad at me
for breaking it.
然后他就生我的气
为了打破它。

02:51.431 --> 02:53.603
Doesn't even ask
if my wheel's okay.
甚至不问
如果我的轮子没问题的话。

02:53.672 --> 02:55.534
- SpongeBob is the same way,
Karen.
- 海绵宝宝也是一样，
凯伦。

02:55.603 --> 02:58.396
After all these years
of my trying to teach him
经过这么多年
我试图教他

02:58.465 --> 03:01.017
how to drive, he doesn't know
the first thing about a car!
怎么开车，他不知道
买车首先要注意的就是！

03:01.086 --> 03:02.948
I'm going crazy!
我要疯了！

03:03.017 --> 03:06.879
[both sob]
[两人都抽泣]

03:06.948 --> 03:08.534
- Hey, hey, hey, hey.
- 嘿，嘿，嘿，嘿。

03:08.603 --> 03:11.017
We're supposed to be having
a good 'ol time,
我们应该有
美好的时光，

03:11.086 --> 03:12.396
not a good 'ol cry.
不好哭。

03:12.465 --> 03:15.051
- [sniffles]
I'm having a good time.
- [抽鼻子]
我过得很开心。

03:15.120 --> 03:17.672
[wheel creaks]
- Me too.
[车轮吱吱作响]
- 我也是。

03:17.741 --> 03:20.189
- Look, guys.
This is a girls night out.
- 看，伙计们。
这是女孩们的夜晚。

03:20.258 --> 03:22.327
And I'm gonna make sure
we have more fun
我会确定
我们有更多的乐趣

03:22.396 --> 03:24.189
than three rats
in a pickle barrel!
比三只老鼠
在泡菜桶里！

03:24.258 --> 03:27.396
Gal pals unite!
all: Yeah!
姐妹们团结起来！
全体：是啊！

03:27.465 --> 03:29.948
[powering up jingle]
Gal pals!
[通电叮当]
嘎啦朋友们！

03:31.258 --> 03:32.603
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

03:32.672 --> 03:34.741
- So, let me get
this straight.
- 所以，让我得到
这个直。

03:34.810 --> 03:38.327
Pranking Plankton will
make me feel better?
恶作剧浮游生物会
让我感觉好点吗？

03:38.396 --> 03:40.396
- You bet your sweet software
it will.
- 你用你的甜蜜软件打赌
会的。

03:40.465 --> 03:42.741
Now let's get pranking.
现在我们开始恶作剧吧。

03:42.810 --> 03:43.913
[clattering]
[咔哒声]

03:43.982 --> 03:45.879
- [grunting]
- Whoa.
- [咕哝]
- 哇哦。

03:48.155 --> 03:49.741
- [grunts]
- Whoa, whoa.
- [咕哝]
- 哇哦，哇哦。

03:49.810 --> 03:51.224
both: Whoa!
两人：哇！

03:52.258 --> 03:53.672
- Whoa!
- 哇！

03:54.741 --> 03:57.741
- Money, money, money, money,
money, money, money.
- 钱，钱，钱，钱，
钱，钱，钱。

03:59.844 --> 04:01.637
- Ready?
- 准备好？

04:01.706 --> 04:02.568
Yah!
啊！

04:02.637 --> 04:04.431
[glass shatters]
- Ouch!
[玻璃碎裂]
- 哎呀！

04:06.189 --> 04:07.568
Krabs!
螃蟹们！

04:07.637 --> 04:10.500
If I wasn't on probation,
I'd call the cops!
如果我没有处于试用期
我要报警！

04:10.568 --> 04:13.258
- Plank-ter-en,
me old nemisis-ser!
- Plank-ter-en，
我老复仇者爵士！

04:13.327 --> 04:15.431
I've got good news-erer:
我有个好消息——呃：

04:15.500 --> 04:18.637
I'm leaving town and
going back into the "Navery,"
我要离开城镇并且
回到“海军”，

04:18.706 --> 04:22.500
so I'm giving you
me secret formuler-er-rer!
所以我给你
我的秘密配方师！

04:23.913 --> 04:27.396
- What? How do I know
this isn't a trap-erer?
- 什么？我怎么知道
这不是陷阱犯吗？

04:27.465 --> 04:29.362
Ah! You got me doing it.
啊!是你让我这么做的。

04:29.431 --> 04:32.362
- It's a going away gift-erer.
- 这是一个送礼物的人。

04:32.431 --> 04:34.120
[sighs]
[叹气]

04:34.189 --> 04:36.120
I'll get me formuler-er
我会得到我的配方师

04:36.189 --> 04:38.362
out of me safe-er-er-er
从我身边安全呃呃呃

04:38.431 --> 04:41.017
and meet you
at the Krusty Krab-er-er-er.
遇见你
在Krusty Krab-er-er-er。

04:41.086 --> 04:43.913
- I'll meet you there,
Eugene honey!
- 我会在那里见到你
尤金亲爱的！

04:43.982 --> 04:45.293
Mwah! Kiss!
哇！吻！

04:45.362 --> 04:46.879
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

04:46.948 --> 04:48.396
- I think he bought it.
- 我想他买了。

04:48.465 --> 04:50.120
- Psst! Come on!
- 嘘！快点！

04:50.189 --> 04:53.017
both: Whoa-whoa!
Wha-whoa!
两人：哇哇！
哇哇！

04:53.086 --> 04:55.327
Whoa!
[groans]
哇！
[呻吟]

04:55.396 --> 04:58.051
- [humming happily]
- [高兴地哼哼]

04:58.120 --> 04:59.844
[all giggling]
[大家咯咯地笑]

05:00.431 --> 05:02.362
I'm here!
我在这儿！

05:02.431 --> 05:04.120
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

05:04.189 --> 05:06.017
[alarm ringing]
[gasps]
[警报响起]
[喘气]

05:06.086 --> 05:07.534
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

05:08.362 --> 05:10.465
- Plankton!
- 浮游生物！

05:10.534 --> 05:12.706
You've interrupted me
beauty sleep!
你打扰了我
美容觉！

05:12.775 --> 05:16.224
- Hey, Eugene. I'll just
take the secret formuler-erer
- 嘿，尤金。我就
采取秘密配方师

05:16.293 --> 05:17.948
heh and be on my way.
呵呵，上路吧。

05:18.017 --> 05:20.568
- Over my dead body!
- 在我的尸体上！

05:20.637 --> 05:23.224
- Whatever you say, Welcher!
- 无论你说什么，韦尔彻！

05:23.293 --> 05:25.362
[blasting, clattering]
[爆炸声、咔哒声]

05:25.431 --> 05:27.637
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

05:27.706 --> 05:29.568
- Y'know, you're right, Sandy.
- 你知道，你是对的，桑迪。

05:29.637 --> 05:31.982
I do feel so much better!
我确实感觉好多了！

05:32.051 --> 05:34.948
[powering up jingle]
all: Gal pals!
[通电叮当]
全体：姐妹们！

05:35.017 --> 05:36.120
[explosion]
[爆炸]

05:36.189 --> 05:38.465
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

05:39.672 --> 05:42.637
- I'm not so sure
about pranking SpongeBob.
- 我不太确定
关于恶作剧海绵宝宝。

05:42.706 --> 05:44.775
He can't help
he's insufferable.
他无能为力
他难以忍受。

05:44.844 --> 05:47.327
- Nobody likes a good prank
more than SpongeBob.
- 没有人喜欢恶作剧
比海绵宝宝还多。

05:47.396 --> 05:49.672
- Mm. Okay.
- 毫米。好的。

05:49.741 --> 05:52.637
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

05:52.706 --> 05:53.982
- [stifled giggle]
- [压抑的笑声]

05:54.051 --> 05:55.396
[furtive music]
[鬼鬼祟祟的音乐]

05:55.465 --> 05:57.913
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

05:57.982 --> 06:01.017
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

06:04.189 --> 06:05.293
- [stifled giggle]
- [压抑的笑声]

06:05.362 --> 06:06.706
Ah!
[grunts]
啊!
[咕哝]

06:06.775 --> 06:09.293
Virtual reality helmet,
engaged.
虚拟现实头盔，
订婚了。

06:09.362 --> 06:11.017
- [murmuring]
- [低语]

06:11.086 --> 06:12.465
[stifled laughter]
[抑制笑声]

06:12.534 --> 06:15.775
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

06:16.500 --> 06:19.086
- Shh, shh. All right, Karen.
You're up.
- 嘘，嘘。好吧，凯伦。
你起来了。

06:19.155 --> 06:20.603
[stifled laughter]
[抑制笑声]

06:21.465 --> 06:24.913
[doorbell]
- Huh? C-coming!
[门铃]
- 啊？ C-来了！

06:26.396 --> 06:28.500
[groans softly]
[轻声呻吟]

06:35.327 --> 06:37.189
Hello? Can I help you?
你好？我可以帮你吗？

06:37.258 --> 06:38.775
- Hello, Mr. SpongeBob.
- 你好，海绵宝宝先生。

06:38.844 --> 06:41.431
I'm just here to deliver
your driver's license.
我只是来送货的
你的驾驶执照。

06:41.500 --> 06:43.637
Congratulations.
恭喜。

06:44.500 --> 06:46.603
- Oh, uh, thanks--[gasps]
- 哦，呃，谢谢--[喘气]

06:46.672 --> 06:48.672
My driver's license!
我的驾照！

06:49.534 --> 06:51.948
- And your new boat!
- 还有你的新船！

06:52.017 --> 06:53.500
- My new boat!
- 我的新船！

06:54.155 --> 06:55.534
Whoa, wow!
哇哇！

06:55.603 --> 06:58.396
[muttering excitedly]
Am I dreaming?
[兴奋地嘀咕]
我是在做梦吗？

06:58.465 --> 06:59.948
[chirping]
[叽叽喳喳]

07:00.017 --> 07:01.500
[screeches]
[尖叫声]

07:01.568 --> 07:03.500
Nope, it's for real.
不，这是真的。

07:03.568 --> 07:04.879
[cart clanging]
[手推车叮当作响]

07:04.948 --> 07:06.327
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

07:06.396 --> 07:08.327
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

07:08.396 --> 07:09.465
- Look at me, everyone!
- 大家看着我！

07:09.534 --> 07:12.017
I'm driving!
I'm driving!
我在开车！
我在开车！

07:12.086 --> 07:13.948
- Oh! That voice.
- 哦！那个声音。

07:14.017 --> 07:17.051
Yes, you're driving!
You're driving me crazy!
是的，你在开车！
你快把我逼疯了！

07:17.120 --> 07:18.051
[gasps]
[喘气]

07:18.120 --> 07:20.120
[laughs maliciously]
[恶意地笑]

07:20.189 --> 07:25.258
I know! Let's make
the road really bumpy.
我知道！让我们做
路真坎坷。

07:25.327 --> 07:26.948
[straining]
[紧张]

07:27.017 --> 07:29.224
- [laughing]
- [笑]

07:29.293 --> 07:31.051
Wha-what?
Whoa!
什-什么？
哇！

07:31.120 --> 07:32.465
Whoa!
Ow!
哇！
噢！

07:32.534 --> 07:34.258
- [murmurs angrily]
- [愤怒地低语]

07:34.327 --> 07:35.913
- Hm, those are some potholes.
- 嗯，这些是一些坑洼。

07:35.982 --> 07:37.982
- Whoa, girl!
Easy there.
- 哇，女孩！
那里很容易。

07:38.051 --> 07:41.258
Maybe it's about time we let
SpongeBob in on the joke.
也许我们是时候让
海绵宝宝也参与了这个笑话。

07:41.844 --> 07:44.603
- [groans, sputters]
Okay.
- [呻吟，气喘吁吁]
好的。

07:44.672 --> 07:46.293
I'll tell him.
我会告诉他。

07:46.362 --> 07:47.396
SpongeBob--
海绵宝宝——

07:47.465 --> 07:48.982
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

07:49.051 --> 07:50.568
- [laughing]
- [笑]

07:50.637 --> 07:52.258
[all scream]
[所有人尖叫]

07:52.327 --> 07:55.189
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

07:55.258 --> 07:56.948
Ah.
啊。

07:57.017 --> 07:58.120
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

07:58.189 --> 07:59.465
[wheels squeaking]
[车轮吱吱作响]

07:59.534 --> 08:00.775
- Poor little guy!
- 可怜的小家伙！

08:00.844 --> 08:02.534
This is all my fault!
这都是我的错！

08:02.603 --> 08:05.120
- No, Puff.
This is all my fault.
- 不，泡芙。
这都是我的错。

08:05.189 --> 08:06.948
[powering up jingle]
- Gal pals!
[通电叮当]
- 朋友们！

08:07.017 --> 08:08.982
- Not now, Karen.
- 现在不行，凯伦。

08:09.051 --> 08:10.051
- Sorry.
- 对不起。

08:10.120 --> 08:12.086
[all cheering]
- [laughing]
[大家欢呼]
- [笑]

08:12.155 --> 08:14.982
Ooh, a turn.
Better use my hand signals.
噢，一转。
最好用我的手势。

08:15.051 --> 08:17.637
- SpongeBob! Look out!
[boats approaching]
- 海绵宝宝！当心！
[船只靠近]

08:17.706 --> 08:19.224
- [laughing]
- [笑]

08:19.293 --> 08:20.637
all: Whoa!
全体：哇！

08:21.327 --> 08:22.465
- [laughs] Hi, I'm driving.
- [笑]嗨，我在开车。

08:22.534 --> 08:24.051
Hi, I'm driving.
- Hey!
嗨，我正在开车。
- 嘿！

08:24.120 --> 08:25.775
- Hi, I'm driving!
- 嗨，我在开车！

08:25.844 --> 08:27.362
[laughs]
[笑]

08:27.431 --> 08:28.534
Look, I got a license.
瞧，我拿到了驾照。

08:28.603 --> 08:30.431
[tires screech, explosion]
[轮胎尖叫声、爆炸声]

08:30.500 --> 08:31.672
- Whoa!
- [grunts]
- 哇！
- [咕哝]

08:31.741 --> 08:33.431
- [giggling] Whoo!
- [咯咯笑] 哇！

08:33.500 --> 08:35.913
Nothing but me
and miles of road.
除了我什么都没有
和数英里的道路。

08:35.982 --> 08:37.810
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

08:37.879 --> 08:39.706
- We gotta stop this cart,
gal pals.
-我们得停下这辆小车
好朋友们。

08:39.775 --> 08:42.637
[powering up jingle]
[通电叮当]

08:42.706 --> 08:44.982
- [laughing]
[all straining]
- [笑]
[一切都紧张]

08:46.775 --> 08:48.258
- Whoa! Whoa!
- 哇！哇！

08:49.362 --> 08:51.500
I'll save you, SpongeBob!
我会救你的，海绵宝宝！

08:52.672 --> 08:54.120
Whoa! Whoa!
哇！哇！

08:54.189 --> 08:55.775
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

08:56.982 --> 09:00.189
- Now I'm flying!
Whee!
- 现在我要飞了！
哎哟！

09:01.293 --> 09:02.775
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

09:02.844 --> 09:04.534
- [inflated groan]
- [膨胀的呻吟声]

09:04.603 --> 09:06.258
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

09:09.258 --> 09:11.155
Huh? Huh?
Huh.
啊？啊？
呵呵。

09:11.224 --> 09:12.396
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

09:12.465 --> 09:14.120
- [straining]
- [紧张]

09:14.189 --> 09:15.120
- Huh?
- 啊？

09:15.189 --> 09:16.465
- [sheepish laugh]
- [羞涩的笑声]

09:16.534 --> 09:18.982
- Mrs. Puff?
- 帕夫夫人？

09:19.051 --> 09:20.672
Oh, I see.
我懂了。

09:20.741 --> 09:23.534
You guys played a prank
on me, huh?
你们玩起了恶作剧
在我身上，嗯？

09:23.603 --> 09:26.637
I love pranks!
[laughs]
我喜欢恶作剧！
[笑]

09:26.706 --> 09:28.706
Thank you, thank you,
thank you!
谢谢你，谢谢你，
谢谢！

09:28.775 --> 09:31.672
You gave me a chance
to live my driving dream.
你给了我机会
实现我的驾驶梦想。

09:31.741 --> 09:33.810
And most importantly...
最重要的是...

09:34.637 --> 09:38.155
Mrs. Puff saved my life!
普芙夫人救了我的命！

09:38.224 --> 09:42.293
Now I will stay by your side
forever!
现在我会留在你身边
永远！

09:42.362 --> 09:43.465
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

09:43.534 --> 09:45.120
- Oh, no!
- 哦，不！

09:45.189 --> 09:46.603
No!
不！

09:46.672 --> 09:47.672
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

09:47.741 --> 09:49.741
- [sighs, grunts]
- [叹气，咕哝]

09:51.086 --> 09:52.465
- Huh?
- 啊？

09:52.534 --> 09:55.431
Oh, you girls got me again!
哦，你们这些女孩又抓住了我！

09:55.500 --> 09:57.120
[laughs]
[笑]

09:57.810 --> 09:59.431
[engine revving]
- Vroom!
[发动机转速]
- 弗鲁姆！

09:59.500 --> 10:01.017
Vroom!
[tires screech]
弗鲁姆！
[轮胎尖叫声]

10:01.086 --> 10:02.775
- I know somewhere
where we can finish
- 我知道某个地方
我们可以在哪里完成

10:02.844 --> 10:05.017
our ladies night in peace.
我们的女士们平安夜。

10:06.534 --> 10:09.534
- [laughing] Good one.
- [笑] 很好。

10:09.603 --> 10:11.844
This was a great idea, Sandy.
这是个好主意，桑迪。

10:11.913 --> 10:15.086
- Yeah, what a nice place
to relax.
- 是的，多好的地方啊
放松。

10:15.155 --> 10:17.189
[all slurping]
[全都发出咕噜声]

10:17.258 --> 10:19.534
[all sigh]
[众人叹息]

10:19.603 --> 10:22.017
- Vroom, vroom!
Honk, honk!
- 呜呜呜！
喇叭，喇叭！

10:22.086 --> 10:24.017
Beep, beep!
Oh, look at me, Mrs. Puff!
嘟嘟嘟！
噢，看着我，帕夫太太！

10:24.086 --> 10:27.017
I'm driving!
[laughs]
我在开车！
[笑]

10:27.086 --> 10:30.465
[shouting]
[blows landing]
[喊叫]
[吹着陆]

10:30.534 --> 10:31.637
[both yell]
[两人大喊]

10:31.706 --> 10:34.017
[blow landing, engine revving]
[爆炸着陆，发动机加速]

10:34.086 --> 10:36.396
all: [sigh]
Men.
全体：[叹气]
男人。

10:37.568 --> 10:39.913
[powering up jingle]
Gal pals!
[通电叮当]
嘎啦朋友们！

10:40.465 --> 10:44.293
[tropical music]
[热带音乐]

10:44.362 --> 10:51.568
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪